    /// Mark all my inbox items read
    ///
    /// Marks every unread item of the inbox tab read, or only those of category (X-17, IN-14, IN-50): the cut-off is the server time of the request, so an item that arrives later stays unread. The items are read in one transaction with a new state_version each, the counters are written again in the same transaction and one inbox.items_bulk_updated and one inbox.counters_changed are published. Announcements of the scope published before the cut-off are read through one read mark of the subscriber and the scope; no row is written per announcement. Nothing is archived. Undo is a short client buffer before the request is sent (IN-15).
